stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> requested
  requested --> claimed: CLAIM
  claimed --> dispatchCommitted: AUTHORIZE_DISPATCH
  dispatchCommitted --> reconcileRequired: LOSE_ACKNOWLEDGEMENT
  reconcileRequired --> retryWait: RECONCILE_NOT_ACCEPTED
  dispatchCommitted --> receiptObserved: OBSERVE_ADMITTED
  receiptObserved --> ready: FINALIZE_READY
  receiptObserved --> blocked: DENY_AFTER_RECEIPT
  blocked --> receiptObserved: RESUME_ADMITTED
  reconcileRequired --> cancelReconcileRequired: CANCEL_UNCERTAIN
  cancelReconcileRequired --> blocked: CANCEL_RECONCILED
  blocked --> requested: RESUME_NEW_GENERATION

  note right of ready
    admission authority + admitted receipt + clear reconciliation
  end note
